[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Too Late]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:09.23]Did the detectives save the diamonds? | 侦探们保住钻石了吗？
[00:14.04]The plane was late and detectives were waiting at the airport all morning. | 飞机误点了，侦探们在机场等了整整一上午。
[00:20.38]They were expecting a valuable parcel of diamonds from South Africa. | 他们正期待从南非来的一个装着钻石的贵重包裹。
[00:26.06]A few hours earlier, | 几小时以前，
[00:28.29]someone had told the police that | 有人向警方报告，
[00:30.52]thieves would try to steal the diamonds. | 说小偷企图偷走这些钻石。
[00:34.32]When the plane arrived, | 当飞机到达时，
[00:36.57]some of the detectives were waiting | 一些侦探等候在
[00:38.70]inside the main building | 主楼内，
[00:40.80]while others were waiting on the airfield. | 另一些侦探则守在停机坪上。
[00:44.89]Two men took the parcel off the plane | 有两个人把包裹拿下飞机，
[00:48.13]and carried it into the Customs House. | 进了海关。
[00:51.80]While two detectives were keeping guard at the door, | 这时两个侦探把着门，
[00:55.93]two others opened the parcel. | 另外两个打开了包裹。
[00:58.93]To their surprise, | 令他们吃惊的是，
[01:00.98]the precious parcel was full of stones and sand! | 那珍贵的包裹里装的全是石头和沙子！
